I still want the top area to feel floating and translucent.

Use native iOS glass/material/blur behavior where possible.

The transition should be gradual rather than a hard clipping line.

Conceptually:

BlueMind AI / Search        ← clear fixed header
=====================
strong blur/fade
medium blur/fade
light blur/fade
scrolling menu content

